.%T BPFtrace reference guide
.%U https://github.com/iovisor/bpftrace/blob/master/docs/reference_guide.md
.\"%D November 1, 1901
.Re
.Sh STANDARDS
The dialect
of the
.Nm
language described in this manual and supported by
.Xr btrace 8
is compatible with BPFtrace.
The syntax is similar to
.Xr awk 1
and dtrace.
